      "sr": "# Izjava vežbača — maloletno lice\n\n**Verzija:** 1\n**Datum stupanja na snagu:** [LEGAL REVIEW: dopuniti datum]\n\n> [LEGAL REVIEW] Posebno proveriti odredbe Porodičnog zakona o zastupanju maloletnika i mogućnost elektronskog davanja saglasnosti. Studio dodatno traži potpis roditelja/staratelja na prvoj poseti.\n\nJa, **{{guardianName}}**, kao **{{guardianRelation}}** (roditelj / zakonski staratelj) maloletnog lica **{{fullName}}**, dajem saglasnost da maloletnik učestvuje na treninzima pilatesa u Baza Pilates Studiju, i izjavljujem sledeće:\n\n## 1. Saglasnost roditelja/staratelja\n\nSaglasan/saglasna sam da maloletnik za koga sam roditelj ili zakonski staratelj koristi usluge Studija i mobilnu aplikaciju Baza, u skladu sa Uslovima korišćenja, EULA i Politikom privatnosti, koje sam pročitao/la i prihvatio/la u ime maloletnika.\n\n## 2. Dobrovoljno učešće i svest o riziku\n\nMaloletnik dobrovoljno učestvuje na treninzima pilatesa. Svestan/svesna sam da pilates kao fizička aktivnost podrazumeva određene rizike, i potvrđujem da maloletnik nema zdravstvenih kontraindikacija za vežbanje, odnosno da sam Studio obavestio/la o svim relevantnim zdravstvenim ograničenjima.\n\n## 3. Lična odgovornost\n\nSaglasan/saglasna sam da, u skladu sa važećim propisima Republike Srbije, **prihvatam odgovornost** za eventualne povrede ili zdravstvene tegobe maloletnika nastale tokom ili kao posledica učešća na treninzima, osim u slučaju krivice Studija (gruba nepažnja ili namera).\n\n## 4. Pravila Studija\n\nPotvrđujem da sam ja, kao roditelj/staratelj, upoznat/a sa pravilima rada pilates kluba i da sam ih objasnio/la maloletniku:\n\n- pravila zakazivanja i otkazivanja termina;\n- pravila korišćenja opreme;\n- pravila ponašanja u prostoru Studija.\n\nObavezujem se da ću zajedno sa maloletnikom poštovati ova pravila.\n\n## 5. Lične stvari\n\nSaglasan/saglasna sam da **Studio ne snosi odgovornost za gubitak ili oštećenje ličnih stvari** koje maloletnik unese u prostor Studija.\n\n## 6. Obrada ličnih podataka maloletnika\n\nSaglasan/saglasna sam da Studio prikuplja i obrađuje lične podatke maloletnika (uključujući datum rođenja i moje podatke kao roditelja/staratelja) u svrhu:\n\n- evidencije članstva;\n- organizacije i sprovođenja treninga;\n- naplate;\n- komunikacije sa mnom kao roditeljem/starateljem u vezi sa terminima i drugim relevantnim informacijama,\n\nu skladu sa Politikom privatnosti Studija i Zakonom o zaštiti podataka o ličnosti.\n\n## 7. Snimanje treninga (opciono)\n\nO saglasnosti za objavljivanje snimaka maloletnika na društvenim mrežama izjašnjavam se posebno. Saglasnost se može opozvati u svakom trenutku.\n\n## 8. Pisana potvrda saglasnosti\n\nRazumem da će Studio, pored ovog elektronskog prihvatanja, **tražiti moj potpis na pisanoj izjavi prilikom prve posete maloletnika Studiju**. Saglasan/saglasna sam da maloletnik može zakazati termine i pre potpisivanja pisane izjave, ali da nakon prve odrađene sesije dalje korišćenje usluga zavisi od pisanog potpisa.\n\n## 9. Prihvatanje\n\nPrihvatanjem ove izjave u aplikaciji Baza, potvrđujem da sam:\n\n- pročitao/la i razumeo/la ovaj dokument;\n- prihvatam ga u celosti **u ime maloletnika** kao njegov/njena roditelj ili zakonski staratelj;\n- da podaci o vremenu prihvatanja (datum, vreme, IP adresa, uređaj) budu pohranjeni kao dokaz pristanka;\n- da Studio može da proveri istinitost mojih izjava i da traži dodatne dokumente o starateljstvu ukoliko se za to ukaže potreba.\n",
      "en": "# Participant Waiver — minor\n\n**Version:** 1\n**Effective date:** [LEGAL REVIEW: fill in date]\n\n> [LEGAL REVIEW] Verify provisions of the Serbian Family Code on representation of minors and the possibility of electronic consent. The Studio additionally requires a paper signature by the parent/guardian on the first visit. In case of discrepancy between Serbian and English, Serbian prevails.\n\nI, **{{guardianName}}**, as the **{{guardianRelation}}** (parent / legal guardian) of the minor **{{fullName}}**, give consent for the minor to participate in pilates training at Baza Pilates Studio, and declare the following:\n\n## 1. Parent / guardian consent\n\nI agree that the minor for whom I am a parent or legal guardian may use the Studio's services and the Baza mobile app, in accordance with the Terms of Service, the EULA and the Privacy Policy, which I have read and accepted on the minor's behalf.\n\n## 2. Voluntary participation and awareness of risk\n\nThe minor participates in pilates training voluntarily. I am aware that pilates as a physical activity carries certain risks, and I confirm that the minor has no medical contraindications, or that I have informed the Studio of any relevant health conditions.\n\n## 3. Personal responsibility\n\nI accept, in accordance with the laws of the Republic of Serbia, **responsibility** for any injury or medical condition the minor may sustain during or as a consequence of training, except where caused by gross negligence or wilful misconduct on the part of the Studio.\n\n## 4. Studio rules\n\nI confirm that I, as parent/guardian, am familiar with the Studio's rules and that I have explained them to the minor:\n\n- booking and cancellation rules;\n- equipment rules;\n- conduct rules on the premises.\n\nI undertake, together with the minor, to follow these rules.\n\n## 5. Personal belongings\n\nI agree that **the Studio is not liable for loss or damage to personal belongings** brought to the premises by the minor.\n\n## 6. Processing of the minor's personal data\n\nI consent to the Studio processing the minor's personal data (including date of birth and my own data as parent/guardian) for the purposes of:\n\n- membership records;\n- organising and delivering training;\n- invoicing;\n- communicating with me as parent/guardian about sessions and related information,\n\nin accordance with the Studio's Privacy Policy and the Serbian Law on the Protection of Personal Data.\n\n## 7. Recording of sessions (optional)\n\nI will give or refuse consent for publication of recordings of the minor on social media separately. Consent may be withdrawn at any time.\n\n## 8. Written confirmation of consent\n\nI understand that, in addition to this electronic acceptance, **the Studio will request my signature on a written waiver during the minor's first visit**. I agree that the minor may book sessions before signing the written waiver, but that continued use of the service after the first attended session depends on the written signature.\n\n## 9. Acceptance\n\nBy accepting this waiver in the Baza app, I confirm that I:\n\n- have read and understood this document;\n- accept it in its entirety **on behalf of the minor** as parent or legal guardian;\n- agree that acceptance metadata (date, time, IP address, device) is stored as evidence of consent;\n- accept that the Studio may verify my statements and request additional documents proving guardianship if required.\n"
